{
  "slug": "claude-cast",
  "name": "Claude Cast",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stream Twitch, YouTube, and Kick live streams alongside your Claude Code sessions. Audio plays via mpv, live chat scrolls in a neo-blessed TUI side pane with colored usernames and badges, and an animated    waveform visualizer shows playback status. Three layout modes (compact, rich, minimal), full slash command control (/claude-cast pause, mute, volume, stop), and keyboard shortcuts for hands-free control.      Twitch chat works zero-config, YouTube and Kick supported out of the box. Runs in a tmux split pane so your coding workflow stays uninterrupted.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `configure` (Configure claude-cast settings including API keys, default layout, volume, and pane width), `setup` (Set up claude-cast by installing all required dependencies (mpv, streamlink, tmux) and verifying the installation), `stream` (Control a live stream player)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `claude-cast`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-cast@claude-community` from `kvreem/claude-cast`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
